{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIREBIRD \u2013 A Fairy-Tale Action-Adventure Platformer. Dark and Fun.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FIREBIRD HAS BEEN STOLEN.<br>THE WORLD IS DROWNING IN SHADOWS.<br>MOVE FAST \u2014 OR DISAPPEAR.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firebird is a high-speed 2D Metroidvania where movement is your weapon.<br>Dash through deadly forests, outsmart mythic guardians, and reshape reality in haunting Dream Worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Download the demo and play now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812210/extras/e05e0b67fb7c4067c6e9d5a03038ef33.poster.avif?t=1771165888\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812210/extras/e05e0b67fb7c4067c6e9d5a03038ef33.webm?t=1771165888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812210/extras/e05e0b67fb7c4067c6e9d5a03038ef33.mp4?t=1771165888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in Unreal Engine 5, Firebird challenges players with tight traversal, creative puzzles, and stylish platforming-driven combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agility and timing are everything. From wall jumps to monster vaults, every movement is a weapon\u2014and every level introduces a new mechanic to master. Whether you\u2019re dodging death traps or reshaping reality in dreamlike sub-levels, Firebird never stops evolving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812210/extras/7e458eb3079ec23e0cf0f6fe3caa3b98.avif?t=1771165888\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812210/extras_big/7e458eb3079ec23e0cf0f6fe3caa3b98.webp?t=1771165888 width=1560 height=930 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes Firebird Special:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement IS Combat \u2013 No button-mashing. Every jump matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream Worlds Twist Reality \u2013 Light and shadow reshape entire levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero Filler \u2013 Every stage introduces a new mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal Outside, Mind-Bending Inside \u2013 Fast platforming meets clever puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in Unreal Engine 5 \u2013 Fluid animations, deep atmosphere, no jank.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOR FANS OF:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hollow Knight<br>Ori and the Blind Forest<br>Celeste<br>Dead Cells <br> <br>Planned for PC <strong>Q2 2026\u00a0</strong>and consoles in <strong>Q3 2026</strong>, Firebird blends the challenge of <i>Hollow Knight</i> with the magic of <i>Ori and the Blind Forest</i>, offering an unforgettable ride through a fading world\u2014and a second chance to reignite its flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812210/extras/67b4337cf458551ce81922f534be597f.poster.avif?t=1771165888\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812210/extras/67b4337cf458551ce81922f534be597f.webm?t=1771165888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812210/extras/67b4337cf458551ce81922f534be597f.mp4?t=1771165888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/image